findings.recommendation:
Use the UUID4_RE regex from models.py as the single source of truth for validation in worker.py as well:

  from content_publisher.models import UUID4_RE

  def _validate_uuid_v4(job_id: str) -> None:
    if not UUID4_RE.fullmatch(job_id):
      raise ValueError(f"job.id is not a canonical lowercase UUID v4: {job_id!r}")

This guarantees worker.py's validation is strictly equivalent to the Pydantic model's validation, eliminating any acceptance-set discrepancy.
